cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RIVeR in your research, please cite the RIVeR paper below. If you use
  the iWave technique, please also cite Dolcetti et al. (2022).
title: "RIVeR: Rectification of Image Velocity Results"
version: 3.5.2
